{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-84104","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118058","text":"RuneFort Interactive Layer — Build Order"}]},{"id":"blk-84105","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118059","text":"Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-84106","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118060","text":"Six prompts that transform RuneFort from a static fort visualizer into an interactive playground with BYOK chat, MCP tool connections, token flow animations, repo import, and workspace management."}]},{"id":"blk-84107","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118061","text":"Dependency Graph"}]},{"id":"blk-84108","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"RFORT-1 (BYOK) ──────┐\n                      ├── RFORT-3 (Chat) ── RFORT-4 (Token Flows)\nRFORT-2 (MCP) ───────┘\nRFORT-5 (Repo Import) ── standalone, uses fort generator\nRFORT-6 (Workspaces) ── standalone, uses auth + supabase"},{"id":"blk-84109","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118062","text":"Recommended Session Plan"}]},{"id":"blk-84110","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118063","text":"Session A: Foundation (RFORT-1 + RFORT-2)"}]},{"id":"blk-84111","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118064","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-118065","text":": \"Build RFORT-1 and RFORT-2. Read "},{"id":"spn-118066","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-1_BYOK.md"},{"id":"spn-118067","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-118068","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-2_MCP.md"},{"id":"spn-118069","text":" for full specs. These are the foundation — BYOK key storage and MCP proxy/client. Port patterns from "},{"id":"spn-118070","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/lib/play/"},{"id":"spn-118071","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-118072","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/src/routes/api/play/mcp-proxy/"},{"id":"spn-118073","text":". Verify: API key modal opens, key persists in localStorage, MCP proxy forwards to graphonomous-mcp.fly.dev, tool discovery returns tools.\""}]},{"id":"blk-84112","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118074","text":"Session B: Chat (RFORT-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-84113","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118075","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-118076","text":": \"Build RFORT-3. Read "},{"id":"spn-118077","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-3_CHAT.md"},{"id":"spn-118078","text":" for full spec. Add the chat panel with tool-use loop. The chat should use the BYOK OpenRouter key (from RFORT-1), call MCP tools via the proxy (from RFORT-2), and execute built-in fort navigation tools that zoom/navigate the fort view. Verify: chat sends messages via OpenRouter, tool calls work (both MCP and built-in), fort navigation tools zoom the view.\""}]},{"id":"blk-84114","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118079","text":"Session C: Token Flows (RFORT-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-84115","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118080","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-118081","text":": \"Build RFORT-4. Read "},{"id":"spn-118082","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-4_TOKENFLOWS.md"},{"id":"spn-118083","text":" for full spec. Add animated particles on Svelte Flow edges representing token throughput. Include a benchmark simulation mode that cascades flows through PULSE phases. Verify: particles animate along edges, speed/color respond to metrics, simulation runs through all phases.\""}]},{"id":"blk-84116","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118084","text":"Session D: Repo Import (RFORT-5)"}]},{"id":"blk-84117","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118085","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-118086","text":": \"Build RFORT-5. Read "},{"id":"spn-118087","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-5_REPO_IMPORT.md"},{"id":"spn-118088","text":" for full spec. Add GitHub repo import that converts repository structure into a fort. Directories → rooms, files → tiles, package manifests → gates. Verify: paste a GitHub URL, import generates a navigable fort, zoom works on imported fort.\""}]},{"id":"blk-84118","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118089","text":"Session E: Workspaces (RFORT-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-84119","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118090","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompt"},{"id":"spn-118091","text":": \"Build RFORT-6. Read "},{"id":"spn-118092","marks":["code"],"text":".claude/prompts/RFORT-6_WORKSPACES.md"},{"id":"spn-118093","text":" for full spec. Add workspace switching tied to amp.workspaces. Each workspace shows its own district of saved forts. Verify: workspace dropdown shows user's workspaces, switching reloads forts, demo mode works without auth.\""}]},{"id":"blk-84120","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118094","text":"Context for All Sessions"}]},{"id":"blk-84121","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-84123","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118095","marks":["bold"],"text":"Framework"},{"id":"spn-118096","text":": SvelteKit 2.x + Svelte 5 (runes: "},{"id":"spn-118097","marks":["code"],"text":"$state"},{"id":"spn-118098","text":", "},{"id":"spn-118099","marks":["code"],"text":"$props"},{"id":"spn-118100","text":", "},{"id":"spn-118101","marks":["code"],"text":"$effect"},{"id":"spn-118102","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-84122","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-84125","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118103","marks":["bold"],"text":"Flow lib"},{"id":"spn-118104","text":": "},{"id":"spn-118105","marks":["code"],"text":"@xyflow/svelte"},{"id":"spn-118106","text":" v1.5.0"}]}],"id":"blk-84124","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-84127","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118107","marks":["bold"],"text":"Style"},{"id":"spn-118108","text":": Dark theme, zinc-900 bg, amber-400 accents"}]}],"id":"blk-84126","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-84129","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118109","marks":["bold"],"text":"SSR"},{"id":"spn-118110","text":": Disabled on "},{"id":"spn-118111","marks":["code"],"text":"/app"},{"id":"spn-118112","text":" route ("},{"id":"spn-118113","marks":["code"],"text":"export const ssr = false"},{"id":"spn-118114","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-84128","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-84131","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118115","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supabase"},{"id":"spn-118116","text":": Lazy client via "},{"id":"spn-118117","marks":["code"],"text":"getSupabase()"},{"id":"spn-118118","text":" (returns null during SSR)"}]}],"id":"blk-84130","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-84133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118119","marks":["bold"],"text":"Existing code"},{"id":"spn-118120","text":": Marketing site + 5-level fort editor already built (see "},{"id":"spn-118121","marks":["code"],"text":"src/"},{"id":"spn-118122","text":" tree)"}]}],"id":"blk-84132","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-84135","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118123","marks":["bold"],"text":"BendScript reference"},{"id":"spn-118124","text":": The "},{"id":"spn-118125","marks":["code"],"text":"/play"},{"id":"spn-118126","text":" implementation in "},{"id":"spn-118127","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com/"},{"id":"spn-118128","text":" is the proven pattern to port from"}]}],"id":"blk-84134","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierajufqwykf46vc2fyxfjyb6xikvlmrchmumm2ccptkqo6vpqrjzqwq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}